    {
      "item_id": "L014",
      "panel_id": "P010",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "旧的武二郎下了冈，巡捕都头武松进了县。",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "S024-S027：虎死，乡人迎武松入县，知县赐为巡捕都头。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "旧的武二郎下了冈，巡捕都头武松进了县。",
      "slot_id": "B010N1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "L015",
      "panel_id": "P011",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "景阳冈上打虎的，就是他！",
      "lang": "zh-Hans",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "script": "Hans",
      "line_break": "cjk",
      "text_source": "S026-S027、S034：武松受贺回城，新升巡捕都头。",
      "source_lang": "und",
      "source_dir": "ltr",
      "text_zh": "景阳冈上打虎的，就是他！",
      "slot_id": "B011N1",
      "style": {
        "font": "project_default",
        "size": 42,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "bubble": "caption"
      }
